# Akimbo with a glove in the left hand (Rerac-vr's akimbo.rs and bomb_glove.rs left-hand throw): the Blaster in
# the right hand (QUEST_SIM_GIVE=15 QUEST_SIM_HOLD=15), the Bomb Glove in the left (QUEST_SIM_LEFT=10), on Novalis.
# The left trigger holds the bomb, a fast left-hand throw flies it, a slow release keeps it; the right gun still
# fires on its own. [vr-throw] lines name the hand and count the ammo; [vr-akimbo] counts the right's rounds.
